configuration. It does not relicense third-party material:

- The workflow configuration under `.github/workflows/` adapted from the AGPL-3.0
  project above remains under AGPL-3.0. It is repository configuration, is not
  linked or combined with the provider binary, and is scheduled to be replaced by
  the shared reusable workflows from `caberdo/terraform-provider-kit`. The Go
  source of this provider is not a derivative work of it.
- `internal/models` shapes derived from the Apache-2.0 Gravitino OpenAPI
  specification remain available under Apache-2.0; the NOTICE and the release
  SBOM carry that attribution.

The published identifiers are the Go module path
`github.com/gravitino/terraform-provider-gravitino` and the Terraform Registry
namespace `registry.terraform.io/caberdo/gravitino`; the source repository is
<https://github.com/caberdo/terraform-provider-gravitino>.

## Third-party dependencies

The complete dependency inventory, with versions and licences, is listed in the
SPDX-JSON SBOM generated by `anchore/sbom-action` in `.github/workflows/release.yml`
and attached to every GitHub release.

Apache Gravitino itself is not included in this distribution; the provider talks to
a Gravitino server over its REST API.
